position = Vector2( 192, 0 )
roomName = "Washrooms"
roomDescription = "You enter the washrooms, looking around as you see those who are freshly out of the shower dry themselves off. You can see where the showers are off towards the back, while the toilets are off towards the left. From the showers, you can hear the moans of a few people getting dirty. The thought of watching someone plough someone else is rather exciting, but something inside you stops you from pursuing it..."
